GoldenEye
HTTP DoS test tool

Stress Testing
Description
GoldenEye is an HTTP DoS test tool that uses KeepAlive and NoCache to stress test web servers.

Installation / Check
Check if installed:

ls goldeneye.py
Install command:

git clone https://github.com/jseidl/GoldenEye.git
Basic Syntax
python goldeneye.py <url>
Common Commands
Command	What it does	When to use	Risk
python goldeneye.py http://target.com

Basic stress test	Test web server	
python goldeneye.py http://target.com -w 50

Set workers	Increase intensity	
python goldeneye.py http://target.com -s 500

Set sockets	More connections	
